Subject: [PATCH 02/40] audit(formats-correctness): regression tests for FC-01
 and FC-06

- json_fuzz.py: idempotence is now checked by Figram itself (re-parse of
  every OK record); red on baseline: 26 of 9786 records unreadable.
- tests/formats/fc01_lean_check.lean: Lean-level parse(render(parse s)).
- b_rfc_table.py: --strict takes a finding list (fc01, fc03, ...);
  the oracle printer follows the amended number rule.

(cherry picked from commit 177355a8bff02654b614b33898d66818bf051d14)

